  <data name="OverviewPage_TextBlock3.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Two labs are available in the navigation menu. Settings apply to real SDK controls. Each lab includes editable data, presets, and action results; TableView also includes an event log. Switch themes without restarting; System uses Windows theme resources.</value>
    <comment>OverviewPage.xaml</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="OverviewPage_Expander4.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>TableView · tables</value>
    <comment>OverviewPage.xaml</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="OverviewPage_TextBlock5.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Text and template columns; sorting, filtering, and grouping through TableViewSource; frozen columns; Pixel / Auto / Star widths; resizing and column order; density, grid lines, headers, tooltips, empty states, and cell editing.</value>
    <comment>OverviewPage.xaml</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="OverviewPage_TextBlock6.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Try clicking a header, dragging a column boundary, selecting a row, and scrolling horizontally. Double-click or press F2 to edit, Enter to commit, and Esc to cancel. Navigate rows with arrows, Home / End / PageUp / PageDown.</value>
    <comment>OverviewPage.xaml</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="OverviewPage_TextBlock7.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Release limitations: None or Single selection, Leading frozen columns, and one header sort key. Some enum values are reserved and do not indicate implemented features.</value>
    <comment>OverviewPage.xaml</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="OverviewPage_Expander8.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Chart · charts</value>
    <comment>OverviewPage.xaml</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="OverviewPage_TextBlock9.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>LineSeries, AreaSeries, and BarSeries; horizontal and vertical bars; LinearAxis, CategoryAxis, and DateTimeAxis; multiple series and axes; legend, grid lines, labels, markers, stroke styles, and per-point overrides.</value>
    <comment>OverviewPage.xaml</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="OverviewPage_TextBlock10.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Choose a scenario and adjust its settings. Add points, try negative values, change axis ranges and label formats. Open the API inspector to edit a specific series or axis property.</value>
    <comment>OverviewPage.xaml</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="OverviewPage_TextBlock11.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>This release provides Cartesian series. Pie charts, 3D, and built-in pan or zoom are not declared in this API.</value>
    <comment>OverviewPage.xaml</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="OverviewPage_Expander12.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Inspector · the public API</value>
    <comment>OverviewPage.xaml</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="OverviewPage_TextBlock13.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The inspector reads properties and signatures from the loaded SDK. Select a live table, column, series, axis, or Samples object. Edit and restore simple properties; use the labs for collections and templates. Copy a catalog of all public types in both namespaces, including properties, methods, and events.</value>
    <comment>OverviewPage.xaml</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="OverviewPage_TextBlock14.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Other additions in 2.5 Experimental</value>
    <comment>OverviewPage.xaml</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="OverviewPage_TextBlock15.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Programmatic theme resource bindings and delegate-based DataTemplate creation; custom ink drying and InkToolbar.TargetInkPresenter; CPU / NPU selection for OCR; a new speech recognition factory; language model name/version, LoRA compatibility status, and generation-stop reasons. Fixes address resource leaks and unreachable .NET WinUI objects. See docs for the full release overview and links.</value>
    <comment>OverviewPage.xaml</comment>
